	skos:editorialNote "ISO 34504 lists pedestrian sub-tags: child, adult, person with disabilities, hearing-impaired, visually-impaired, road-works crew, person pushing stroller, person in wheelchair, etc. Cyclist sub-tags: bicyclist, e-Bike user, skater, motorcycle, moped/scooter. ASAM OpenLABEL uses role-based categories."@en ;
